海绵宝宝和我在打架。

09:20.551 --> 09:22.172
Fighting?
斗争？

09:22.275 --> 09:24.035
Well, I can't believe
I'm saying this, but...
好吧，我不敢相信
我是这么说的，但是……

09:24.103 --> 09:28.862
SpongeBob Squarepants, I hereby
sentence you and your friend
海绵宝宝，我在此
对你和你的朋友判刑

09:29.137 --> 09:31.965
to detention.
拘留。

09:32.241 --> 09:33.655
Detention?
拘留？

09:33.758 --> 09:37.689
May Neptune have mercy
on your soul.
愿海王星怜悯
在你的灵魂上。

09:41.793 --> 09:46.137
In one day I've gone from
good noodle to bad egg.
有一天我离开了
好面条变坏鸡蛋。

09:46.241 --> 09:48.000
It's all stupid Patrick's fault.
这都是愚蠢的帕特里克的错。

09:48.310 --> 09:49.724
I hate you, Patrick.
我恨你，帕特里克。

09:50.000 --> 09:51.517
I hate you more.
我更恨你了。

09:51.620 --> 09:53.482
Well, I'd hate you
no matter what.
好吧，我会恨你
不管怎样。

09:53.827 --> 09:56.862
Yeah? Well I'd hate you
even if I didn't hate you.
是的？好吧，我会恨你
即使我不恨你。

09:57.241 --> 09:59.137
I'd hate you
even if that made sense.
我会恨你
即使这是有道理的。

09:59.482 --> 10:01.344
I'd hate you
even if you were me.
我会恨你
即使你是我。

10:01.620 --> 10:03.206
That's how much I hate you.
我就是这么恨你。

10:03.482 --> 10:05.689
I'd hate you if even, uh...
我什至会恨你，呃...

10:05.931 --> 10:07.379
mm...
毫米...

10:07.482 --> 10:09.896
I'd hate you even
if the lightbulb
我什至会恨你
如果灯泡

10:10.172 --> 10:11.586
keeping Roger alive went out.
让罗杰活着就出去了。

10:38.206 --> 10:42.103
I'm sorry I called you
a stupid star!
抱歉我给你打电话了
一个愚蠢的明星！

10:42.206 --> 10:43.655
I'm sorry I got you in trouble
很抱歉给你带来了麻烦

10:43.758 --> 10:45.482
and got you moved
to the back of class
让你感动
到班级后面

10:45.827 --> 10:47.148
and got your good
noodle star removed
得到了你的好处
面条星已移除

10:47.172 --> 10:48.517
and shot spitballs...
并射击了纸团...

10:48.620 --> 10:50.034
I'm sorry
your apology is so long.
对不起
你的道歉这么长。

10:50.137 --> 10:51.827
Me too. Let's save Roger!
我也是。我们来救罗杰吧！

10:52.517 --> 10:53.620
I'll keep him warm
我会让他温暖

10:53.724 --> 10:55.827
and you get a lightbulb
from the supply closet.
然后你得到一个灯泡
从供应柜。

10:58.275 --> 11:01.241
Lightbulb.
灯泡。

11:01.517 --> 11:05.379
But why does it have
to be so far away?
但为什么它有
这么远？

11:17.448 --> 11:19.172
I'm coming, SpongeBob!
我来了，海绵宝宝！

11:19.482 --> 11:21.413
Oh, where's Patrick?
哦，帕特里克在哪儿？

11:21.689 --> 11:23.241
Oh, forget it.
哦，算了。

11:23.344 --> 11:24.824
I've got to go
find Roger some warmth.
我得走了
给罗杰一些温暖。

11:29.827 --> 11:31.241
The lightbulb!
灯泡！

11:31.344 --> 11:32.793
Without its warmth,
Roger will die.
没有它的温暖，
罗杰会死。

11:33.068 --> 11:34.103
Roger!
罗杰！

11:34.206 --> 11:35.758
Without him
没有他

11:35.862 --> 11:37.422
the lightbulb will have
nothing to warm.
灯泡会有
没有什么可以温暖的。

11:43.379 --> 11:44.862
We did it, Patrick.
我们做到了，帕特里克。

11:45.103 --> 11:46.413
We saved Roger's life.
我们救了罗杰的命。

11:46.689 --> 11:48.482
Good job, boys.
干得好，孩子们。

11:50.068 --> 11:51.551
I saw the whole thing
我看到了整个事情

11:51.655 --> 11:53.413
from behind
my one-way chalkboard
从后面
我的单向黑板

11:53.827 --> 11:55.587
and I couldn't be happier
with your teamwork.
我高兴极了
与您的团队合作。

11:55.862 --> 11:59.448
I've decided to give
you each one gold star.
我决定给予
你们每人一颗金星。

11:59.827 --> 12:02.965
Although, I'm not sure
what saving an egg
虽然，我不确定
节省一个鸡蛋有什么用

12:03.206 --> 12:05.551
has to do with boating school.
与划船学校有关。

12:05.793 --> 12:07.275
Boating school?
划船学校？

12:07.379 --> 12:09.172
I thought this
was Spanish class.
我以为这个
是西班牙语课。

12:09.482 --> 12:11.206
See you, SpongeBob.
再见，海绵宝宝。

12:11.310 --> 12:13.103
See you, Big Fat Meanie.
再见，大胖贱人。

12:16.310 --> 12:17.827
Hey, what'd I miss?
嘿，我错过了什么？

12:29.793 --> 12:32.551
Uh...
呃...

12:32.793 --> 12:34.482
What do you like better?
你更喜欢什么？

12:34.793 --> 12:36.724
The coral bits
or the nacho oyster skins?
珊瑚碎片
还是玉米片牡蛎皮？

12:36.827 --> 12:38.034
I like neither.
我都不喜欢。

12:38.137 --> 12:39.758
Can I take your order?
我可以接受您的订单吗？

12:39.862 --> 12:41.022
How about the barnacle rings?
藤壶戒指怎么样？

12:41.103 --> 12:42.517
Are they any good?
他们有什么好处吗？

12:42.620 --> 12:44.275
No. What will you have?
不，你要什么？

12:44.586 --> 12:46.186
Well, uh, what's your vote
on the kelp...
嗯，你投什么票
在海带上...

12:46.551 --> 12:48.896
Sir, let's just get
this out of the way.
先生，我们来吧
这不碍事。

12:49.000 --> 12:50.724
I hate everything on the menu.
我讨厌菜单上的所有东西。

12:51.000 --> 12:52.586
Now what do you want?
现在你想要什么？

12:52.862 --> 12:54.103
Psst. Try
the coral bits.
嘘。尝试一下
珊瑚碎片。

12:54.344 --> 12:55.724
Uh, I'll try the coral bits.
呃，我会尝试一下珊瑚碎片。

12:56.000 --> 12:57.586
That'll be one dollar.
那将是一美元。

13:01.758 --> 13:03.034
What's going on?
这是怎么回事？

13:03.275 --> 13:05.103
Something stupid, I'm sure.
我确信有些愚蠢的事情。

13:09.344 --> 13:10.344
Yippee!
耶皮！

13:20.965 --> 13:22.758
Whoo-ha! Whoo-ha! Whoo!
呼哈！呼哈！呼！

13:22.862 --> 13:25.448
See? I told you.
看？我告诉你了。

13:25.689 --> 13:27.655
What's wrong
with Mr. Krabs?
怎么了
和蟹老板一起？

13:30.413 --> 13:31.448
Nothing, lad.
没什么，小伙子。

13:31.793 --> 13:33.379
Do you know what this is?
你知道这是什么吗？

13:33.655 --> 13:35.344
A very dirty dollar?
非常肮脏的美元？

13:35.689 --> 13:40.137
No! This is my one millionth
dollar earned.
不！这是我的一百万分之一
赚到的美元。

13:40.241 --> 13:44.758
Every Krab's goal in life
is to make a million dollars
每个蟹蟹的人生目标
就是赚一百万美元

13:45.068 --> 13:46.620
and now I got mine.
现在我得到了我的。

13:46.896 --> 13:48.413
Congratulations, sir.
恭喜你，先生。

13:48.517 --> 13:52.793
You have just given me
my one millionth dollar.
你刚刚给了我
我的一百万美元。

13:52.896 --> 13:54.241
Great.
伟大的。

13:54.517 --> 13:55.896
What do I win?
我能赢什么？

13:56.000 --> 13:57.206
Nothing.
没有什么。

13:57.482 --> 13:58.482
Now get out.
现在出去吧。

13:58.655 --> 13:59.758
What?
什么？

13:59.862 --> 14:01.000
Get out!
出去！

14:01.275 --> 14:02.724
Everybody get out!
大家都出去吧！

14:03.000 --> 14:04.413
You're spoiling my moment.
你破坏了我的时刻。

14:04.689 --> 14:07.000
My millionth dollar.
我的第一百万美元。

14:07.103 --> 14:08.758
Congratulations,
Mr. Krabs.
恭喜，
蟹老板。

14:09.068 --> 14:10.862
Congratulate yourselves, lads.
恭喜你们自己，小伙子们。

14:11.241 --> 14:13.758
A captain's nothing
without his loyal crew.
队长什么都不是
没有他忠实的船员。

14:14.172 --> 14:15.758
I mean, a crew like you
comes along
我是说，像你这样的船员
来了

14:16.034 --> 14:17.931
maybe once in a lifetime.
也许一生一次。

14:18.034 --> 14:19.827
And to reward you for helping me
并奖励你对我的帮助

14:20.137 --> 14:21.551
make my millionth dollar
赚取我的第一百万美元

14:21.793 --> 14:23.413
I'm taking you on a trip.
我带你去旅行。

14:23.689 --> 14:25.000
Wow! A trip!
哇！一次旅行！

14:25.275 --> 14:26.758
I can't believe
it, Mr. Krabs.
我不敢相信
是的，蟹老板。

14:27.103 --> 14:28.827
Where are we going,
Fancy Spring?
我们要去哪里，
喜欢春天吗？

14:28.931 --> 14:29.931
No.
不。

14:30.137 --> 14:31.413
Pamper Island?
帮宝岛？

14:31.689 --> 14:33.241
Try again.
再试一次。

14:33.344 --> 14:35.551
Oh, oh, oh!
Bikini Bottom
Folk Village.
哦，哦，哦！
比基尼泳裤
民俗村。

14:35.793 --> 14:36.862
Better than that.
比那更好。

14:37.137 --> 14:39.034
Clam fishing?
钓蛤蜊？

14:39.448 --> 14:42.137
This is the reward we get
for all our hard work?
这就是我们得到的奖励
为了我们所有的辛勤工作？

14:42.413 --> 14:44.137
Fishing for stinky clams
钓臭蛤

14:44.448 --> 14:46.793
in a smelly old boat
on a filthy lagoon?
在一艘发臭的旧船上
在肮脏的泻湖上？

14:47.034 --> 14:48.448
You call this fun?
你管这叫好玩？

14:48.689 --> 14:50.275
Aw, come on now, Squidward
噢，来吧，章鱼哥

14:50.586 --> 14:52.896
three fellas at sea
with nothing to do
三个小伙子在海上
无事可做

14:53.172 --> 14:55.068
but throw their lines
in the water
但抛出他们的台词
在水中

14:55.172 --> 14:57.896
catch a few clams
and then throw them back.
抓几只蛤蜊
然后把它们扔回去。

14:58.000 --> 15:00.206
Don't you think that's fun?
你不觉得这很有趣吗？

15:00.310 --> 15:02.206
No.
不。

15:02.310 --> 15:04.551
And to think I could be wearing
a powdered wig right now.
想到我可以穿着
现在有一顶撒了粉的假发。

15:04.931 --> 15:07.965
Hey, Squidward,
you want me to
cast out over here
嘿，章鱼哥，
你想让我
被赶到这里

15:08.068 --> 15:09.241
so you can watch me?
所以你可以看着我吗？

15:09.655 --> 15:10.935
How about you
cast out over there
你呢
被赶到那边

15:11.172 --> 15:12.413
so I can ignore you.
这样我就可以无视你了。

15:12.655 --> 15:13.827
Okay.
好的。

15:20.620 --> 15:23.586
Hey, watch where
you're swinging that...
嘿，看哪里
你正在摇摆那个...

15:23.862 --> 15:24.965
SpongeBob
海绵宝宝

15:25.068 --> 15:26.620
be careful with...
小心...

15:30.241 --> 15:32.586
Okay, I've had enough.
好吧，我受够了。

15:34.413 --> 15:37.206
Oh, Squidward,
you got to lighten up.
哦，章鱼哥，
你必须放松一点。

15:37.517 --> 15:39.482
Sure, the lad's a bit overeager
当然，这小伙子有点太急躁了

15:39.758 --> 15:40.896
but you've got to learn
但你必须学习

15:41.172 --> 15:42.344
to roll with the punches.
与时俱进。

15:42.620 --> 15:44.448
Go with the flow.
随波逐流。

15:44.551 --> 15:46.758
And don't bring anything
on the boat
并且不要带任何东西
在船上

15:47.034 --> 15:48.586
that you ain't prepared to lose.
你不准备失去。

15:50.586 --> 15:51.827
Ooh! Ugh!
哦！啊!

15:52.068 --> 15:53.862
Me millionth dollar!
我的第一百万美元！

15:54.137 --> 15:55.344
SpongeBob
海绵宝宝

15:55.448 --> 15:57.517
wait!
等待！

15:57.620 --> 16:00.586
SpongeBob, you hooked
me millionth dollar
海绵宝宝，你着迷了
我的第一百万美元

16:00.827 --> 16:02.310
on the back swing.
在后面的秋千上。

16:02.413 --> 16:04.137
Reel it in before I keelhaul ya.
在我龙骨拖你之前把它卷起来。

16:06.517 --> 16:07.965
Oh, no.
哦，不。

16:08.068 --> 16:09.620
SpongeBob, quick, reel it in!
海绵宝宝，快点，把它卷起来！

16:09.862 --> 16:11.413
Can't you hear the music?
你听不到音乐吗？

16:11.517 --> 16:13.137
That's a 4/4 string
ostinato in D minor.
这是4/4弦
D小调固定音。

16:13.517 --> 16:15.034
Every sailor knows
that means death.
每个水手都知道
这意味着死亡。

16:15.344 --> 16:16.624
Reel it in before it's too late.
在为时已晚之前把它卷起来。

16:16.827 --> 16:18.172
Hurry, SpongeBob!
快点，海绵宝宝！

16:18.275 --> 16:20.206
The music's getting faster!
音乐越来越快了！

16:21.310 --> 16:23.034
There you are,
you stinking bilge rats!
你在那里，
你们这些臭臭的舱底老鼠！

16:23.310 --> 16:26.586
Stop playing that music!
别再播放那个音乐了！

16:26.862 --> 16:28.551
Stop it, please!
请停止吧！

16:28.827 --> 16:30.344
I'm begging you.
我求你了。

16:30.655 --> 16:32.517
Come on, honey.
You can make it!
来吧，亲爱的。
你可以的！

16:32.793 --> 16:34.103
Swim faster!
游得更快！

16:34.379 --> 16:35.793
Come to me, baby!
到我这里来吧，宝贝！

16:36.068 --> 16:37.551
Come on back!
回来吧！

16:37.827 --> 16:39.620
Hurry, SpongeBob!
快点，海绵宝宝！

16:39.965 --> 16:41.379
Here she comes.
她来了。

16:41.482 --> 16:43.034
Oh, please, please,
please, please.
哦，拜托，拜托，
拜托，拜托。

16:43.137 --> 16:44.137
Please, please, please.
拜托，拜托，拜托。

16:44.241 --> 16:45.379
She made it!
她做到了！

16:45.482 --> 16:46.724
Yeah!
是的！

16:46.965 --> 16:48.551
Oh, oh! Oh, ho-ho!
哦，哦！哦，嗬嗬！

16:48.655 --> 16:51.896
For a second or two,
I thought she was a goner.
一两秒钟，
我以为她已经死了。

17:09.965 --> 17:12.137
So, some trip, hey, Mr. Krabs?
那么，去旅行吧，嘿，蟹老板？

17:12.379 --> 17:14.275
Oh, Squidward
哦，章鱼哥

17:14.586 --> 17:16.482
you're never going
to believe it.
你永远不会去
相信它。

17:16.862 --> 17:21.862
A giant blue-lipped clam
ate me millionth dollar!
巨大的蓝唇蛤
吃了我一百万美元！

17:24.413 --> 17:26.206
I lost me dollar
我失去了我的美元

17:26.448 --> 17:28.344
and I'll never get it back.
我永远不会把它拿回来。

17:28.620 --> 17:30.206
Never, never, never, never.
永远，永远，永远，永远。

17:30.586 --> 17:32.758
I've never seen Mr. Krabs
so broken up.
我从没见过蟹老板
就这样分手了。

17:35.068 --> 17:36.379
Oh, please.
哦，拜托。

17:36.482 --> 17:37.896
He's such a drama queen.
他真是一位戏剧女王。

17:38.172 --> 17:39.172
Come on,
Mr. Krabs.
来吧，
蟹老板。

17:39.275 --> 17:40.275
Drop the act.
放弃这个行为。

17:42.275 --> 17:45.206
Mr. Krabs, it's
just a stupid dollar.
蟹老板，是
只是一块愚蠢的美元。

17:47.620 --> 17:49.448
For Pete's sake,
Mr. Krabs
为了皮特的缘故，
蟹老板先生

17:49.724 --> 17:50.931
suck it up!
吸干它！

17:54.344 --> 17:55.724
Mr. Krabs.
蟹老板。

17:57.137 --> 17:58.517
Mr. Krabs.
蟹老板。

18:00.206 --> 18:02.068
Okay, okay,
Mr. Krabs.
好吧，好吧，
蟹老板。

18:02.379 --> 18:04.758
We'll help you get
your dollar back.
我们将帮助您获得
你的美元回来了。

18:05.275 --> 18:06.655
You will?
你会？

18:06.758 --> 18:07.793
Great!
伟大的！

18:08.068 --> 18:09.379
Wait right here.
就在这里等一下。

18:12.344 --> 18:16.310
Here's where clam fishing
gets serious.
这里是钓蛤蜊的地方
变得严肃起来。

18:16.413 --> 18:18.586
Okay, you boys man
the fishing poles.
好吧，你们这些男孩子
钓鱼竿。

18:18.965 --> 18:21.793
And I'll keep me eyes peeled
for Old Blue Lip.
我会睁大眼睛
为老蓝唇。

18:22.034 --> 18:23.586
Aye-aye, Captain.
是的，船长。

18:23.689 --> 18:27.068
And remember, we don't leave
until we catch that clam
请记住，我们不会离开
直到我们抓住那只蛤蜊

18:27.379 --> 18:30.275
and rescue me dollar.
救救我美元。

18:38.862 --> 18:39.862
That's it.
就是这样。

18:40.137 --> 18:41.448
I'm finished.
我完成了。

18:41.724 --> 18:43.103
We've been here for three days
我们已经在这里三天了

18:43.344 --> 18:44.689
and haven't gotten a nibble.
并且还没有被咬过。

18:44.965 --> 18:46.551
This is hopeless!
这是没有希望的！

18:46.931 --> 18:49.448
Yeah. And I've got to get home
to feed Gary.
是的。我得回家了
去喂加里。

18:51.689 --> 18:53.413
We're going to die out here
我们会死在这里

18:53.517 --> 18:56.275
just because a clam ate
Mr. Krabs' stupid dollar.
只因为蛤蜊吃了
螃蟹先生那愚蠢的美元。

18:56.517 --> 18:59.000
Well, if he wants
his dollar back
好吧，如果他愿意的话
他的美元回来

18:59.275 --> 19:01.310
I say we give it to him.
我说我们把它给他。

19:01.413 --> 19:02.517
Know what I mean?
知道我的意思吗？

19:02.793 --> 19:03.862
Huh? Huh? Huh?
啊？啊？啊？

19:04.103 --> 19:05.310
Oh, I get you.
哦，我明白了。

19:07.517 --> 19:09.758
Mr. Krabs,
Mr. Krabs.
蟹老板先生，
蟹老板。

19:10.034 --> 19:11.793
Look what we got!
看看我们得到了什么！

19:12.448 --> 19:13.862
Oh, could it be?
噢，可能是这样吗？

19:14.103 --> 19:15.896
Me millionth dollar!
我的第一百万美元！

19:26.896 --> 19:29.068
Whoa.
哇哦。

19:29.344 --> 19:30.379
Wait a minute.
等一下。

19:33.379 --> 19:36.206
This isn't me millionth dollar.
这不是我的第一百万美元。

19:36.310 --> 19:38.103
This is an ordinary dollar
这是一枚普通的美元

19:38.379 --> 19:39.655
that's been crumpled up
那已经被弄皱了

19:39.758 --> 19:41.931
torn slightly,
soaked in the lagoon
轻微撕破，
浸泡在泻湖中

19:42.379 --> 19:45.517
and kissed with Coral Blue
Number Two Semi-gloss Lipstick.
并与珊瑚蓝接吻
二号半光泽唇膏。

19:45.862 --> 19:48.137
Actually, it's Coral Blue
Number Three.
其实是珊瑚蓝
第三。

19:48.482 --> 19:51.758
I trusted you,
and you gave me this!
我信任你，
你给了我这个！

19:52.034 --> 19:53.689
I can't believe
我不敢相信

19:53.793 --> 19:56.241
me own crew would betray me
like this.
我自己的船员会背叛我
像这样。

19:59.275 --> 20:01.448
No. Uh-uh.
不，呃呃。

20:01.551 --> 20:05.034
No. We will not
be swayed by
tears anymore.
不，我们不会
被影响
眼泪不再了。

20:05.310 --> 20:07.034
I see.
我懂了。

20:07.137 --> 20:10.206
Then I guess I have no choice
but to offer a reward.
那我想我别无选择
但要提供奖励。

20:10.310 --> 20:11.724
You're kidding?
你在开玩笑吧？

20:11.827 --> 20:13.148
Whoo! It isn't
another fishing trip?
呼！它不是
另一次钓鱼之旅？

20:13.172 --> 20:14.310
No.
不。

20:14.413 --> 20:16.586
It's this sandwich.
就是这个三明治。

20:20.344 --> 20:21.517
A sandwich?
三明治？

20:21.620 --> 20:23.620
You expect me to break my back
你期望我折断我的背

20:23.896 --> 20:25.137
over a sandwich?
在三明治上？

20:25.379 --> 20:27.068
Not asandwich.
不是三明治。

20:27.310 --> 20:29.793
Thesandwich.
三明治。

20:30.034 --> 20:31.172
Whatever.
任何。

20:31.275 --> 20:33.758
We've got plenty more to...
我们还有很多事情要做...

20:36.172 --> 20:37.620
eat.
吃。

20:37.724 --> 20:40.068
Now, I think
we understand each other.
现在，我想
我们互相理解。

20:40.172 --> 20:41.827
Nobody eats
没人吃

20:41.931 --> 20:44.586
until I get my millionth dollar
back.
直到我拿到第一百万美元
回来。

20:44.793 --> 20:46.172
Uh, SpongeBob
呃，海绵宝宝

20:46.482 --> 20:47.758
can I have a word with you?
我可以和你说句话吗？

20:48.034 --> 20:49.206
Have you noticed
你注意到了吗

20:49.310 --> 20:50.310
that Mr. Krabs
has gone
蟹老板
已经走了

20:50.586 --> 20:51.758
completely insane?!
完全疯了？！

20:52.034 --> 20:53.172
What do you mean?
你是什​​么意思？

20:53.275 --> 20:54.310
Just look at him.
只要看看他。

20:56.931 --> 20:58.941
Squidward, he's lost something
near and dear to him.
Squidward, he's lost something
对他来说很亲近。

20:58.965 --> 21:00.379
Haven't you...?
你不是……吗？

21:00.482 --> 21:01.689
Look again.
再看看。

21:05.862 --> 21:06.931
You're right.
你说得对。

21:07.034 --> 21:08.275
How do we get out of here?
我们怎样才能离开这里？

21:08.551 --> 21:10.068
If we're real quiet
如果我们真的很安静

21:10.448 --> 21:12.034
we can sneak over
to the lifeboat.
我们可以偷偷过去
到救生艇。

21:12.275 --> 21:13.344
Okay.
好的。

21:17.448 --> 21:19.068
So, you thought you'd skip out
所以，你以为你会跳过

21:19.310 --> 21:20.482
on old Krabs, did you?
老蟹，是吗？

21:20.862 --> 21:22.241
Even after you promised
to help me.
即使在你答应之后
来帮助我。

21:22.551 --> 21:24.068
I know what you're thinking.
我知道你在想什么。

21:24.310 --> 21:25.510
"It's just a dumb old dollar."
“这只是一枚愚蠢的旧美元。”

21:25.758 --> 21:27.103
"Let's just leave the old man."
“我们还是离开老夫吧。”

21:27.379 --> 21:28.379
"He won't notice."
“他不会注意到的。”

21:30.724 --> 21:33.896
Well, it's not going down
like that.
还好，并没有下降
像那样。

21:34.137 --> 21:35.724
There's only one use
只有一种用途

21:35.827 --> 21:38.241
for a backstabbing crew
like you:
对于一个背后捅刀子的人来说
像你一样：

21:38.482 --> 21:40.931
live bait!
活饵！

21:41.137 --> 21:42.275
You're crazy.
你疯了。

21:42.655 --> 21:44.379
If that clam didn't come before
如果那只蛤蜊之前没有来过

21:44.482 --> 21:46.689
what makes you think
he'll come now?
是什么让你觉得
他现在会来吗？

21:46.931 --> 21:49.586
Oh, he'll come.
哦，他会来的。

21:55.517 --> 21:57.344
Mr. Krabs, listen.
蟹老板，听着。

21:57.448 --> 21:59.344
I work with SpongeBob
all day long
我和海绵宝宝一起工作
一整天

21:59.448 --> 22:01.551
so I know what I'm talking about
when I say...
所以我知道我在说什么
当我说...

22:01.655 --> 22:04.344
you are completely
out of your mind!
你完全是
疯了！

22:11.551 --> 22:14.103
Get us out of here!
带我们离开这里！

22:14.379 --> 22:16.862
Come on, fresh meat!
来吧，新鲜的肉！

22:20.172 --> 22:21.724
Keep thrashing!
继续殴打！

22:22.000 --> 22:24.000
He likes it!
他喜欢！

22:27.379 --> 22:29.206
Come on, boy!
来吧，孩子！

22:29.448 --> 22:30.965
Closer...
靠近一点...

22:31.206 --> 22:32.310
closer.
更近了。

22:32.413 --> 22:33.448
Almost there.
快到了。

22:35.172 --> 22:36.172
That's it!
就是这样！

22:39.931 --> 22:41.310
A-ha!
啊哈！

22:41.586 --> 22:43.310
Whoo-hoo-hoo-hoo!
呼呼呼呼！

22:43.413 --> 22:45.034
Look, boys!
看，孩子们！

22:45.310 --> 22:46.724
I finally got it!
我终于明白了！

22:46.827 --> 22:49.448
I finally got
me millionth dollar!
我终于得到了
我的第一百万美元！

22:57.379 --> 22:59.413
Oh, poor Mr. Krabs.
哦，可怜的蟹老板。

22:59.517 --> 23:02.275
Gone forever out of our lives.
永远消失在我们的生活中。

23:02.517 --> 23:04.827
Why couldn't it have been me?
为什么不能是我呢？

23:04.931 --> 23:09.000
Yes. Why couldn't
it have been you?
是的。为什么不能
是你吗？

23:10.793 --> 23:12.233
Why did he have to
go like this? Why?
为什么他必须
就这样走吗？为什么？

23:12.482 --> 23:14.137
Why did he have to go like this
他为什么要这样走

23:14.448 --> 23:16.379
and leave me tied to this idiot?
让我和这个白痴绑在一起？

23:19.655 --> 23:21.413
Hello, boys!
哈喽，孩子们！

23:21.517 --> 23:23.379
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

23:23.655 --> 23:25.448
Have you boys met...
小伙伴们有没有遇到过...

23:25.551 --> 23:26.931
me millionth dollar?
我一百万美元？

23:29.275 --> 23:31.206
Wow! How did you
get it back?
哇！你怎么样
拿回来吗？

23:31.482 --> 23:32.862
It wasn't easy.
这并不容易。

23:32.965 --> 23:34.379
Old Blue Lips is
quite the fighter
老蓝唇是
相当战斗机

23:34.724 --> 23:37.448
so eventually,
we settled on a trade.
所以最终，
我们达成了一项交易。

23:37.551 --> 23:38.551
What did you give him?
你给了他什么？

23:38.793 --> 23:40.655
Nothing important.
没什么重要的。

